{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"時事全方位｜加快公屋流轉(二)\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/2026-11-16-14-08-17dl19SwSp.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】題目：加快公屋流轉</p><p>公屋輪候時間預料會降至4.5年，還有何措施可以加快流轉？房委會就通過提高「家有初生家庭」按揭成數等措施，成效有幾大？</p><p>嘉賓：</p><p>房委會資助房屋小組委員會委員梁文廣</p><p>團結香港基金助理研究總監梁躍昊</p><p></p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-16T06:54:13.111046+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":114,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-16T06:34:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T01:59:50.282578+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-16T06:47:48.591577+00:00","content_hash":"dba19f138bef07e558cb8b497be9b7c8ad3268d8c8ec492d28e819bc986976f6","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-16T06:54:13.111046+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}